    "date": "2025-11-02T09:14:00.000Z",
    "timestamp": 1762082040,
    "postText": "My Dexcom G6 keeps asking for calibration twice a day even though the sensor was pre-calibrated. xDrip+ shows 'calibration needed' and the values freeze until I enter the fingerstick. Anyone else seeing this on the latest nightly?",
    "postAuthorId": "100001111111101",
    "postAuthor": "Alicia Chen",
    "postAuthorProfileUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/alicia.chen.9402",
    "postImages": [],
    "postReactionsCount": 12,
    "commentsCount": 3,
    "reactions": [
      { "name": "Jordan Lee", "type": "Like", "link": "https://www.facebook.com/jordan.lee.77" },
      { "name": "Sam Okafor", "type": "Haha", "link": "https://www.facebook.com/samokafor" }
    ],
    "postComments": [
      {
        "commentText": "This is usually caused by having the G6 receiver pairing active at the same time as xDrip+. Disable native mode on the transmitter in xDrip+ settings, then start the sensor again.",
        "commentAuthorId": "100002222222202",
        "commentAuthor": "Marco Ruiz",
        "commentAuthorProfileUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/marco.ruiz",
        "commentUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/584126708394913/posts/pfbid0SampleA1xY/?comment_id=100002222222202",
        "commentTimestamp": 1762089600
      },
      {
        "commentText": "That worked for me last week. I turned off the 'allow native G6' toggle under hardware data source and the extra calibration prompts stopped.",
        "commentAuthorId": "100003333333303",
        "commentAuthor": "Priya Nair",
        "commentAuthorProfileUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/priya.nair",
        "commentUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/584126708394913/posts/pfbid0SampleA1xY/?comment_id=100003333333303",
        "commentTimestamp": 1762093200
      },
      {
        "user": { "id": "100004444444404", "name": "Tom Becker", "profileUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/tombecker" },
        "commentText": "Same fix for me on Android 14 with the patched collector.",
        "commentTimestamp": 1762096800
      }
    ]
  },
  {
