  {
    "id": "pfbid0SampleA3pL",
    "url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/584126708394913/posts/pfbid0SampleA3pL/",
    "inputUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/584126708394913",
    "groupName": "xDrip+ users",
    "groupUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/584126708394913",
    "date": "2025-11-05T07:02:00.000Z",
    "timestamp": 1762333320,
    "postText": "Omnipod DASH paired to the phone but xDrip+ does not show glucose from the pod controller. I am on Android 15, build from yesterday.",
    "postAuthor": "Marco Ruiz",
    "postAuthorId": "100002222222202",
    "postReactionsCount": 3,
    "commentsCount": 1,
    "reactions": [{ "name": "Alicia Chen", "type": "Like", "link": "https://www.facebook.com/alicia.chen.9402" }],
    "postComments": [
      {
        "commentText": "xDrip+ never reads glucose from the DASH itself — the pod controller app broadcasts to xDrip+. Check that broadcast is enabled in the app and that xDrip+ has the 'companion app' data source selected.",
        "commentAuthorId": "100003333333303",
        "commentAuthor": "Priya Nair",
        "commentUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/584126708394913/posts/pfbid0SampleA3pL/?comment_id=200000000001",
        "commentTimestamp": 1762336920
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "pfbid0SampleA4mN",
    "url": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/584126708394913/posts/pfbid0SampleA4mN/",
    "inputUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/584126708394913",
    "date": "2025-11-08T21:22:00.000Z",
    "timestamp": 1762644120,
    "postText": "After the Android 16 update xDrip+ keeps losing the Bluetooth connection to the transmitter every few hours. Re-pairing fixes it until the next drop. Rolled back to Android 15 and it is stable again.",
    "postAuthor": "Tom Becker",
    "postAuthorId": "100004444444404",
    "postReactionsCount": 9,
    "commentsCount": 2,
    "reactions": [
      { "name": "Priya Nair", "type": "Like", "link": "https://www.facebook.com/priya.nair" },
      { "name": "Sam Okafor", "type": "Like", "link": "https://www.facebook.com/samokafor" }
    ],
    "postComments": [
      {
        "commentText": "Known Android 16 issue with the Bluetooth GATT cache. Clear the xDrip+ app cache and forget/re-pair the transmitter once; do not toggle the phone's Bluetooth.",
        "commentAuthorId": "100002222222202",
        "commentAuthor": "Marco Ruiz",
        "commentUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/584126708394913/posts/pfbid0SampleA4mN/?comment_id=200000000002",
        "commentTimestamp": 1762647720
      },
      {
        "commentText": "Clearing the cache worked here too, thanks.",
        "commentAuthorId": "100001111111101",
        "commentAuthor": "Alicia Chen",
        "commentUrl": "https://www.facebook.com/groups/584126708394913/posts/pfbid0SampleA4mN/?comment_id=200000000003",
        "commentTimestamp": 1762651320
      }
    ]
  },
